infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title Attention on a toy query
  desc q=[1,0], k1=[1,0], k2=[0,1], d_k=2
  sequences
    - label Compute dot products
      desc q·k1=1; q·k2=0
      icon calculator
    - label Scale scores by sqrt(2)
      desc [0.7071, 0]
      icon scale
    - label Softmax scores
      desc [0.6698, 0.3302]
      icon chart bar
    - label Weighted sum of values
      desc v1=[10,0], v2=[0,20]; output=[6.70,6.60]
      icon sum
theme
  palette #2d92d5 #2e9e52 #ee8517
